       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CALLER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 A PIC 99 VALUE 7.
       01 B PIC 99 VALUE 5.
       01 R PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "ADDER" USING A B R
           DISPLAY "RESULT " R
           STOP RUN.
       END PROGRAM CALLER.
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ADDER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01 X PIC 99.
       01 Y PIC 99.
       01 Z PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING X Y Z.
           COMPUTE Z = X + Y
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM ADDER.
